10 REM TUNNEL - NESTED ROTATING SQUARES - MODEL II BASICG 640X240
20 SCREEN 0 : CLS
30 DIM X(4), Y(4), U(4), V(4)
40 REM PIXELS ARE 2X TALL AS WIDE SO Y IS HELD IN SQUARE UNITS (0-478) AND HALVED WHEN DRAWN
50 FOR F = 5 TO 25 STEP 5
60 G = (F / 100)
70 LINE (0,0)-(639,239), 0, BF
80 X(1) = 80 : Y(1) = 0 : X(2) = 559 : Y(2) = 0 : X(3) = 559 : Y(3) = 478 : X(4) = 80 : Y(4) = 478
90 FOR N = 1 TO 60
100 FOR I = 1 TO 4
110 J = (I + 1) : IF (J = 5) THEN J = 1
120 LINE (X(I),(Y(I) / 2))-(X(J),(Y(J) / 2))
130 U(I) = (X(I) + (G * (X(J) - X(I)))) : V(I) = (Y(I) + (G * (Y(J) - Y(I))))
140 NEXT I
150 FOR I = 1 TO 4 : X(I) = U(I) : Y(I) = V(I) : NEXT I
160 NEXT N
170 FOR D = 1 TO 3000 : NEXT D
180 NEXT F
190 GOTO 50
